## Provider marks

The Garmin, EXR and iGPSPORT marks under `app/views/import_sources/icons/`
identify the services they name. They belong to their owners, are used only
to label the corresponding connection, and imply no affiliation or
endorsement. The Garmin mark comes from Simple Icons (CC0), the EXR mark is
the service's own favicon, and the iGPSPORT mark is a simplified trace of the
manufacturer's icon.

